{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a945f64cc44763645bb4a07845aa839035193d8969e32e4509a9b3c8146bb19", "ja": "（瑞希と紗代子が、大規模なゲームイベントの\nアンバサダーに任命され、ステージをやり遂げた！）", "zh": "（瑞希和纱代子被任命为大型游戏活动的大使，并成功完成了舞台演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "0b70716b6702d9be8ae0c7911e0b5b098c33b678e5c1991cdd4e62216eb7ab13", "ja": "高山さん、お疲れさまでした。\n流れるような司会進行……さすがだったぞ。", "zh": "高山小姐，辛苦了。\n行云流水般的主持……不愧是你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "54cfa98f52b23c3445ad3a46f32b6170d3d6963cf24e1c840995cf39fe99b2ac", "ja": "ありがとう！　瑞希ちゃんもゲームの解説が上手で、\nお客さん、すごく盛り上がってたよ♪", "zh": "谢谢你！瑞希的游戏解说也很棒，\n观众们都超级嗨呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a3b325477bc6cc49709219e1a8877cac520ea291cb8f71c35b6a51f7d78f1ca9", "ja": "よく頑張ったな、ふたりとも！　会場で流れたPVも\nカッコいいって、SNSで話題になってるそうだ。", "zh": "你们两个都干得漂亮！听说现场播放的PV\n很帅气，在社交媒体上也引起了热议呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "b6bd40a55f7b16fc2f21244e5797776a6124e76d6045ec26502e4df2195ba0c4", "ja": "私もわかります！　瑞希ちゃんの二段ジャンプは、\nゲームの世界にぴったりのアクションでしたよね！", "zh": "我也明白！瑞希的二段跳，真是非常适合游戏世界的动作，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "d21f5402a65390c7064ff35a63fa8a439a4280d7dc76a253f25e1d263c4605df", "ja": "どうしてもやってみたくて、監督に提案しました。\nみなさんに喜んでもらえたなら、何よりです。", "zh": "因为实在很想试试看，所以就向导演提议了。如果大家能喜欢，我就再高兴不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e281a0972438769991bc5f012f6a60ad0526ee7897669a9d41f5a98b093a4896", "ja": "そうだな。ふたりのおかげで、\nお客さんの心に残るイベントになったと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。多亏了你们两个人，我觉得这次活动成了让客人们难以忘怀的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "f56b1a7528c5e68369eccb760c761ddc98094b21d55bc65f64c7b031b213d29a", "ja": "よかった……。またイベントに出ることがあれば、\n次はあの二段ジャンプを披露してみたいです。", "zh": "太好了……要是下次还能参加活动，\n我也想试着展示一下那个二段跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "7fedc054d6be0031378a56f6299b8251d86752caf9f777c1f0ab8fce8e28bc8c", "ja": "ええ～っ！？　あれって実際にできるの！？", "zh": "诶诶～！？那个真的能做到吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8366585ce18bcf2df302481c74aac8b4ae9314cb56bb2d33257ef562abc2716", "ja": "はい。特訓を重ねれば、実現可能かと。\n残念ながら、今の私では筋力が……しょぼーん。", "zh": "是的。如果反复特训，应该就能实现。\n遗憾的是，以现在的我来说，肌肉力量还……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9f224b20b96bcfef1dac60f8aafb6cc6cd682627caed742e1d0b356ea43fd1a4", "ja": "体ひとつで挑戦するなら、そうだな……。でも、\nサポートする仕掛けがあれば、すぐできそうだけど。", "zh": "要是只凭身体去挑战的话，这个嘛……不过，\n要是有辅助用的机关，感觉马上就能做到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "9a73171e27177e9c509df6a4c0b0e67604631f861ae616d18d0b6fbb5c6214fd", "ja": "仕掛け……あっ！　透明な台を使ったり、ワイヤー\nアクションなら、私たちでもできそうですね！", "zh": "机关……啊！如果使用透明台子，或者进行威亚动作，我们好像也能做到呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "0920379a6ce8aa3dd5ca4668ca361a507a121828d76fbe7aa2ef5e00032ee6a2", "ja": "確かに……。でも最終的には己の肉体ひとつで\n飛んでみせます。……限界を超えるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "确实……。但最终我要只凭自己的身体飞起来。……要超越极限，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "1ce5403340951358ba2897d7747b7bf104bf9d993668982ebf7a942f12c2daed", "ja": "ふふっ。そこまで自信満々に言われると、\nなんだか私にも、できそうな気がしてきちゃった。", "zh": "呵呵，你都说得这么自信满满了，搞得我好像也觉得自己能做到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1014_p", "source_sha256": "314ebc2e6b8d1456fed4460e9ecbfd9514f8e037d3f99725237a5b61c2f68b93", "ja": "い、いや。さすがに今の瑞希や紗代子じゃ、\n二段ジャンプは難しいんじゃないか……？", "zh": "不、不是。再怎么说，现在的瑞希和纱代子，\n想做到二段跳还是太难了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "d2b200e922a11a2b1f1b8d90a2d1ef0a9164ea7de7cf823cf92edc6e834f4d10", "ja": "そんなことありませんよ、{$P$}。\n挑戦する前から諦めるなんてもったいないです！", "zh": "没那回事，{$P$}。还没挑战就放弃，太可惜了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "d10035718fd9c81b77ae153512447eccbcc1d59a21f2a1f7a0f128bc1d842a1a", "ja": "そうですね。何事もやってみなければわかりません。\n未来は予測不可能です。", "zh": "没错。不管什么事，不试试看就不会知道。\n未来是无法预测的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1017_p", "source_sha256": "bdb8845d7a2ce450b0bebb1ab8df3639e30bb74968c3d84de099651fc96cca29", "ja": "な、なるほど。\nそれもそうだな……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。\n确实也是这个道理……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "04376bfd323d42035fb17d2260e8f6a410f6f108108a5ae6bdc9b182a0b093c2", "ja": "ふふっ、私も新しい技、見つけられるかな？\n瑞希ちゃん、いろいろ試してみようね！", "zh": "呵呵，我也能找到新的招式吗？\n瑞希，我们一起尝试各种方法吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "33a1f3935c9be6011988e34aeff40753200f1f50d0fc8a0fb045f83dfaa6838d", "ja": "はい、一緒に頑張りましょう。\n高山さんとなら、新しい可能性を導き出せそうです。", "zh": "好的，一起努力吧。\n和高山小姐一起的话，感觉能发掘出新的可能性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0414_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a8793b72d04aa8b2a98d7dc8585979ddc9a200bfc8756b45c51e9730a971cbfa", "ja": "（ふたりが一緒なら、不可能も可能にできそうな気が\nするな。これからのパフォーマンスが楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（感觉只要两个人一起，就连不可能也能变成可能。真期待接下来的表演啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
